  id: silent_knock_part2a_wakes
  title: The Stranger Wakes
  bodyText: "He opens his eyes on Day 37. Radiation burns across his neck. He was
    a cartographer. Says he knows a pre-war cache \u2014 sealed, untouched. Grid
    coordinates. He writes them down on a strip of packaging.\n\nHe needs water.
    He's barely holding on."
